{"author":{"id":"2462ded6f56967dde059994c39a506c79e39e5dfd10c5a07f07a23a5652a8353"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1775014786,"nonce":"arFVh8Zx5tavDe38NDH1LuxMZpM=","title":"OpenHandsAgent adapter skeleton + registry + marker translation + tests","message":"Create adapters/agents/openhands.py implementing the CodingAgent protocol. Register as \"openhands\" in AGENT_REGISTRY.\n\n## Command Construction\n\n```python\ncmd = [\n    \"openhands\", \"--headless\", \"--json\", \"--always-approve\",\n    \"--override-with-envs\",\n    *self.extra_args,\n    \"-t\", prompt,\n]\n```\n\nFor resume: `cmd += [\"--resume\", self._session_id]` (conversation ID from previous run).\n\nEnv vars set in subprocess env:\n- LLM_API_KEY from os.environ\n- LLM_MODEL from os.environ\n- LLM_BASE_URL from os.environ (optional)\n\n## JSON Event Parsing\n\nEvents are separated by \"--JSON Event--\" lines. Each event is a JSON object with a \"kind\" field:\n\n- MessageEvent (source: user) — user input\n- ActionEvent (source: agent) — agent actions (FileEditorAction, TerminalAction, FinishAction)\n- ObservationEvent (source: environment) — tool results\n\n## Marker Mapping\n\n| OpenHands Event | Nightshift Marker |\n|---|---|\n| ActionEvent + FileEditorAction (create/edit) | @@CHECKPOINT@@ (description from summary field) |\n| ActionEvent + FinishAction | @@DONE@@ |\n| reasoning_content field | @@LOG@@ |\n| ActionEvent + TerminalAction | tool_call |\n| ObservationEvent | tool_result |\n| Process exit non-zero | PROCESS_EXIT |\n| No output for stall_timeout_s | STALL |\n\n## Session ID Extraction\n\nConversation ID appears in stderr at exit: \"Conversation ID: \u003cuuid\u003e\"\nExtract and store as _session_id for resume support.\n\n## TDD\n\nWrite tests/test_openhands_agent.py first:\n- Constructor accepts command, stall_timeout_s, extra_args\n- start() builds correct command\n- start() sets LLM_* env vars in subprocess\n- stream_events() parses JSON events separated by \"--JSON Event--\"\n- _parse() maps ActionEvent/ObservationEvent to AgentEvent\n- _parse() emits CHECKPOINT for FileEditorAction\n- _parse() emits DONE for FinishAction\n- _parse() emits LOG for reasoning_content\n- _parse() falls back to TEXT for unparseable lines\n- Stall detection works\n- PROCESS_EXIT on process end\n- terminate() kills process\n- send_input() raises RuntimeError\n- Session ID extraction from stderr\n- Resume mode includes --resume flag\n\nUpdate test_config_factories.py to verify create_agent() with kind: openhands.\n\n## Files\n- tests/test_openhands_agent.py (new)\n- adapters/agents/openhands.py (new)\n- core/config/factories.py (add registry entry)\n- tests/test_config_factories.py (update)\n\n## Reference\nSee docs/openhands-discovery/findings.md for real output samples and format details.\n\nREQ: REQ-030 (OpenHands agent adapter). Add to docs/requirements.md.","files":null}]}